# Vue / Inertia Frontend — VA-QLDA

> **Cập nhật 2026-06-03** — sau refactor Phase 2–5.

## Cấu trúc

| Path | Vai trò |
|------|---------|
| `Pages/{Domain}/` | Inertia pages — mỏng, bọc `AppLayout` |
| `Components/Ui/` | App primitives: Modal, Drawer, PageHeader, AppDialog |
| `Components/DailyReport/`, `Notifications/` | Feature chưa migrate `modules/` |
| `modules/project/components/` | Project feature UI (Sprint, Task, Dashboard, …) |
| `modules/project/config/` | columns.js, table column configs |
| `shared/ui/` | Reusable UI: Badge, Avatar, ProgressBar, form/* |
| `shared/composables/` | useToast, usePermission, useFilter |
| `composables/use*.js` | Feature logic — **không** import `xlsx` trong `.vue` |
| `stores/` | Pinia: auth.js, ui.js |
| `constants/index.js` | Frontend constants |
| `Layouts/AppLayout.vue` | Shell, nav, flash → `useToast` |

**Import alias:** `@/modules/...`, `@/shared/...`, `@/Components/...`, `@/composables/...`

> `Components/Project/` **đã xóa** — dùng `modules/project/components/`.

## Page pattern

```vue
<script setup>
import { Head } from '@inertiajs/vue3';
import AppLayout from '@/Layouts/AppLayout.vue';
import PageHeader from '@/Components/Ui/PageHeader.vue';
import ProjectCard from '@/modules/project/components/ProjectCard.vue';
defineProps({ items: Array });
</script>

<template>
  <Head title="…" />
  <AppLayout>
    <template #header>
      <PageHeader title="…" subtitle="…" icon="…" icon-color="brand" />
    </template>
  </AppLayout>
</template>
```

**Content header:** `.cursor/rules/content-header.mdc` + skill `content-header` — không lặp `PageHeader` trong main; `back-href` chỉ drill-down.

## Forms & data

- Inertia: `useForm`, `router.post/put`, `preserveScroll: true`.
- Toast: `import { useToast } from '@/shared/composables/useToast'`.
- Axios JSON: notifications — `route('notifications.index')`.
- Permissions: `usePage().props.auth.user.role`, entity `can` từ props.

## UI

- Icons: `<AppIcon name="task" />`.
- Dialog/toast: `useDialog`, `useToast` — không `alert()` native.
- Modal data: `dirty` + `useConfirmClose`.
- ESLint: `--max-warnings=0` (pre-commit Husky).
- **Content header (bắt buộc):** `.cursor/rules/content-header.mdc` + skill `content-header`.
- **Datagrid toolbar (bắt buộc):** `.cursor/rules/datagrid-toolbar.mdc` + skill `datagrid-toolbar` — `DatagridToolbarSearch` (`hide-label`, `inline-actions`, `half`, `compact`), `DatagridToolbarActionButton`, `FilterDatePicker`, grid lọc, opt-in `default: false`. Mẫu đầy đủ: `DailyReport/History.vue`; classic: `CostReport.vue`; tab: `ProjectFeedbackPanel.vue`.
- **KPI summary strip (bắt buộc khi clone /feedback):** `.cursor/rules/kpi-summary-strip.mdc` + skill `kpi-summary-strip` — `kpi-strip` / `kpi-card`, `FeedbackSummaryBar.vue`, prop `summary`, lọc nhanh qua emit.

## Cấm

- Business rules Excel trong `.vue` (dùng composable).
- Ba modal riêng cho Nhập/Xuất/Đối soát — một `*DataModal` 3 tab.
- Import từ `@/Components/Project/` (path cũ).

